WEBVTT

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:00.960
Thanks for

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.410
[Privacy beep]

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:04.620
I'm Liv, how can I help?

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:07.590
Hiya, I just wanted to ring in and book an appointment.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.780
Thanks, can you please tell me if this is for you or someone else?

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.980
It's for me, I'm new in the area, I want to register with the dentist

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.750
and then get checked up as well.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.140
Got it, are you looking for a new patient check-up appointment?

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:28.060
Also, do you have a day or time that suits you best?

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:31.300
Ideally today, if we could do later on today, that'd be great and yeah,

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.430
this would be a new patient check-up.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.580
The first available appointment this afternoon

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:44.560
is at 2.30 or three in the afternoon or 3.30.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.020
Which one works for you?

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.430
Can we do three o'clock?

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.220
Thanks, may I have your full name

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:54.620
and the best phone number to reach you on please?

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.660
Yeah, my name is [Personal name redacted]

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.830
and the best number to reach me on is this one.

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:04.810
[Privacy redaction]

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:13.440
Your new patient check-up appointment

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:18.100
is booked for Wednesday, the 7th of October at 3pm.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:21.460
The team has all your details and looks forward to seeing you then.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.120
Is there anything else I can help with?

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:25.730
No, that would be all. Thank you. Bye-bye.
